w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t-zvnqgrj6oQ7kNvwHGB7xe&_nc_oc=Adk5aPqRri2_PjdiYrnNb0TWDL7j7yfbBj7-MfPRpwUJleIIGuTCmHBNLtGhG6UwdYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aft7d6p4Ub4WZHo9-NkTulDUuctabN8W6GWHftYLRxZlow&oe=69A81E2A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IWrObvn8giYQ7kNvwGwo4q9&_nc_oc=AdlXVt9YEv3SbiGk9APGHEtdZaCeKWDf7nS1KWmxpRpHl9VBNUpbhFECVsCV5bpoJPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aft_onrhP8gtixzqKbrSsdMce6tIVPJkTzkFChQ3I8YU7A&oe=69A830DE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1emxghfopCMQ7kNvwF47l3a&_nc_oc=AdmVfdOa3ZKJSmyYMKzDP_sBb7r012y1A_ToRCSoASKXgji1ToNLeAkQrF2hjmKUf_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aft0gq76rcxhG7NjkzYQpKoUfmNxcuM-fuJNw5_XgJdwtg&oe=69A81FB1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9